<description>&lt;p&gt;Israel is conducting air, drone and ground operations in southern Lebanon, striking targets and carrying out detonations that have killed civilians and injured others, while Hezbollah fires artillery at Israeli positions and has begun cash payments to war victims and displaced families. The United Nations reports 300,000 people displaced in Lebanon by the fighting. Israel has also built a new road in the Shebaa Valley buffer zone, a development not mentioned previously. The conflict, which began in October 2023, continues to generate civilian hardship and displacement. 4,335 battle-related deaths occurred in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxQcXpWaS1XQXFHNUdGeW82N1dvTTNIaW9qanlESlBuT2l2M0hwVUtXUDVqc3lnSWdlQVdWWVRLb0ZPQ1daYVhNR1NkVGJIU2M4cXRSOExUTmdRNTBVVlRONDBSYTRxYmpSWjcwU0kwWThIX2xwU2V3YTgzblRBX081Rl96S2lkZUFidklMT1pVeldkTC02dDRJaE1UWDhXbjhDblRwNTZfd0FqSEpEVUpPczVnTGpCUnp4QW9tSm1tekoyWVk?oc=5&quot;&gt;Qatar news agency&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiT0FVX3lxTE1XMUZJNUpfeUs4czhtbThKN2YyRXJXZWJ4ZkVJV0czWHR0eGtYOGtkajJDamFjYnJwcVFvUEZqLTBzWGhxaTBTMFoxcDVSa2c?oc=5&quot;&gt;وكالة سبأ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiyAFBVV95cUxPZFJJSER1VFlwandJRHlIYldLeEUtSXA3MEV2S3pOdUhyaDYySDItdUxzZXBwVzJpM0g3UUFpcWpJWlZUYWExMWt6aWt2c2RBWXFSUkw1T0Nyd2xuSHctbE1UOUdtUWpLV3ZwcDhiTjVJTGNfYlNIWkRWRUlfV3VPamd0LVJweTlZQUF6TllSbHZXX1VMX1VOUFdkc2xIVGxMMDMtMDROdXFnZ29JRFF3d05UbDZLOWoxajBNVWtMekgwVVBYbzUwcg?oc=5&quot;&gt;The National&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxOaVFwY3JULXowaEM3LTRlQUVmQnNiTHNkdndTRElvV3dxVmFULTUyOURsT1JiZXRuY0c4Y25VbEpOODYzQnFpRF9FTnpaTFZJeVhHU2lESnE0U3hKaFRlZ1l